# playpick cell: mode=menus view=820x1180,touch save=carried
#
# Continuation of -4.play in spirit (fresh invocation, same recipe): kill
# Bonegrinder 10-normal twice in one script, then open RECORD in the same
# invocation to see whether the per-boss line reflects these two pulls --
# no prior menus session ever checked RECORD after playing a fight in the
# same script; every prior RECORD read was either a cold carried profile
# (always empty, #273) or never followed an actual kill.
open #b=marrow&s=10&h=0
tap class:warrior:arms
tap pull
waitscreen fight 15
play good 130
wait 3
tap outcome:retry
waitscreen fight 15
play good 130
wait 3
targets
key Escape
tap back
tap record
targets
shot record
